{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>But if injury occurs.</b> To the woman." "<b>And you shall give a life for a life.</b> Our Sages disagree in the matter: some say an actual life, and some say money but not an actual life — for one who intends to kill this one and killed that one is exempt from death, and he pays his heirs his monetary value as he would be sold in the market (there)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:37.004400780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}